        "id": 35294,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-07-23T05:39:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sadly I couldn’t watch the whole thing, though I did load up the recording so I could see how it ended. Really do like Tachyon’s old costume and kind of hope to see that on the future promo card of hers whenever she gets it. Can’t wait to actually see the cover after all the coloring is done. Keep up the fantastic artwork Adam. Also if you ever feel like doing one of them again it would be really awesome if you could do it on a saturday or tuesday if at all possible that way I will be able to witness the entire thing of it. Only if you are able to, I can always watch the afterwork later if you can’t.</p>",
