        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/adam/{size}/1946_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-07-23T23:04:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’ll most likely be doing it again this weekend, hopefully saturday, I still have to finish that cover. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> Thanks to everyone who joined me on there!  (BTW, I’d found you can post in the chat by unclicking the facebook box, I’d become annoyed at it posting to twitter and fb also.)</p>",
